sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Flutter UI
    participant API as ElysiaJS API
    participant DB as Neon DB

    Note over UI,DB: ── Calculate who owes who ──

    UI->>API: GET /bills/:id/debts
    API->>DB: SELECT item_assigns JOIN bill_items JOIN bill_members
    DB-->>API: raw assign data
    API->>API: prorate each shared item ÷ number of assignees
    API->>API: add service_charge + VAT per person
    API->>API: run min-cash-flow algorithm
    Note over API: reduces N*(N-1) possible transactions<br/>down to minimum needed
    API-->>UI: [{from_user, to_user, amount}]

    UI->>UI: show Debt Summary Screen
    UI->>UI: show Bill Per Person breakdown

    Note over UI,DB: ── User initiates payment ──

    UI->>API: POST /payments {bill_id, from_user_id, to_user_id, amount}
    API->>DB: INSERT payments {status: 'pending'}
    DB-->>API: payment {id}
    API->>API: generate PromptPay QR (EMVCo CRC-16)
    Note over API: encode: promptpay_number + amount
    API-->>UI: {qr_data, amount, to_user}

    UI->>UI: show PromptPay QR Screen
    Note over UI: user opens banking app<br/>scans QR → transfers

    Note over UI,DB: ── Confirm payment ──

    UI->>UI: upload slip to Cloudinary (Unsigned Preset)
    UI-->>UI: slip_url
    UI->>API: PUT /payments/:id/confirm {slip_url}
    API->>DB: UPDATE payments SET status='confirmed', slip_url
    DB-->>API: updated payment
    API-->>UI: confirmed ✓
    UI->>UI: debt status → "จ่ายแล้ว ✓"

    alt All payments confirmed
        UI->>API: PATCH /bills/:id {status: 'settled'}
        API->>DB: UPDATE bills
        DB-->>API: ok
        API-->>UI: bill closed
    end
